Text_en:
Another theft from the first companion. You really made the rebellion the first companion. Today at 8:37 am, I bought a 7 gig package. At 8:46 in the morning, I received an SMS saying that the volume is over. This level of betrayal to customers is truly unforgivable. My dear, retweet it so that everyone will understand. Pay attention to the photos.  
@www_mci_ir
 @support_mci
